+| `SToggle`, `SIconToggle`, `SPicker`, `SSegmentedControl`, `STextField`, `SSlider` | SettingsUI | Binding-driven setting controls |
+| `SDetentSlider`, `SDetent` | SettingsUI | Native slider with labeled, clickable magnetic stops |
+| `STokenField` | SettingsUI | Wrapping chip editor with host-defined normalization and validation |
+| `SChoiceGroup`, `SChoiceOption` | SettingsUI | Equal-height choices that adapt their column count to available width |
+| `SSummaryDisclosure` | SettingsUI | Disclosure with a visible value summary and host-owned expansion |
+| `SIconActionButtonStyle`, `settingsScrollAwareHover(_:)` | SettingsUI | Themed icon actions that clear stale hover after scrolling or window changes |
